        4,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spartan_Keyes%2C_San_Jose"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The former American Can Company factory and JTR Distributors warehouses once powered Spartan Keyes’ industrial boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spartan_Keyes%2C_San_Jose"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Today, former warehouses host art studios and galleries such as Citadel Art Studios and Art Ark, fueling a vibrant creative scene.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spartan_Keyes%2C_San_Jose"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In September 2024, the Spartan Keyes Master Plan received a National Park Service grant to develop a new community park.",
